        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Namuroet ŋina a ŋainakineta a ŋuna epeyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Toduk a ŋakito ke eewoi Namuroet. Emaikina erae ŋina eriyan ŋiwaetin ŋuluomwon daadaŋ, erae ŋisepyon ŋimitae ŋiarei, torae kiŋaren ka neni iteotor ŋimitae ŋiarei, ido aoyau alokwap tari kidiama torae emita epei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak ibore ŋini esibit ŋamomwar lokoonae ŋulu a Namuroet a ŋin, emaikina ikes erae ibore ipei bon, ido toburusik eburonis Namuroet ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toyeu ŋamoti ŋunakidyata ekuron ŋolo a Namuroet a ŋin, kitiyau ŋamudet ekuron, ŋabakulei ŋunawuaset ka ŋiboro ŋulu kibeleet akiriŋ ta ŋiboro ŋulu edakitere akim. Emaikina iyoŋ kitiyau ŋiboro ŋul daadaŋ a eburonis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisibus, kiwuanak ŋasuwa a eburonis nawaetin a Namuroet a ŋin, ido kiwuanak eburonis ŋololuluŋ lokoonae ŋulu alokwap ŋasuwa ŋun; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tosipok Namuroet tooma nasuwa ŋun, pena ŋikoonae a Namuroet kidiama neniluluŋ, kimyek Namuroet ikyara iwadio anasuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau anakito a ŋiwo ŋakito ŋuna edakitere Namuroet ŋin, toburusik eburonis nakito ŋun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido kirepak ŋakito ŋun nasuwa ŋunaluluŋ ŋun, ikotere todakitere Namuroet alowaetin a ŋuluarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Namuroet a ŋakito a ŋuna edapal, kimyek tooma eorori, lopite ŋolo ikitoodikinitor iyoŋ Akuj alomoru.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alapatu ŋina alokidiŋ Eema ka ŋanaŋgae keŋ ŋuna enenosi nen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kitiyak kiŋa Eema ŋolo iryamununoi ŋol neni elapat. Kiwuak lowae ŋolo alo Kwap nenilapat nen ŋanaŋgae ŋuna amilimilak ŋuna edonyuno ejok; torae aoyau kec alosepyon ŋimitae ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋiomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau ke eburonis ŋipirin a akibois a ŋin ŋatomoniarei ka ŋawoeta a ŋipirin a ŋul ŋatomoniarei, nai ŋikodoce ŋulu inenetere ŋanaŋgae lopirin kaapei ka ŋikabobooe ŋulu imoryanakinere ŋanaŋgae ŋun, emaikina kitiyau ke esilipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau ŋiboro ŋulu iwasiyete alowae a ŋolo alo Kuju Eema ikwaan ka ŋulu alo Kwap Eema. Kitiyau ŋanaŋgae ŋuna erae aoyau alosepyon ŋimitae ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋiomwon, kiwuak nakibois ŋin ŋipirin ŋatomoniarei ŋulu itiyaunitae ke eburonis ka ŋawoeta kec ŋatomoniarei ŋuna itiyaunitae ke eburonis; nai ŋikodoce ŋulu inenetere ŋanaŋgae lopirin kaapei ka ŋikabobooe ŋulu imoryanakinere ŋanaŋgae, emaikina kitiyau ke esilipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak nalapatu alowae a ŋolo alo To ŋanaŋgae ŋuna erae aoyau kec alosepyon ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiuni. Kiwuak nen ŋipirin ŋitomon ka ŋawoeta kec ŋatomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina aoyau alokiŋaren alapatu ŋin erae ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiuni alowae a ŋolo alo Kide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋanaŋgae ŋuna erae aoyau kec alosepyon ŋimitae ŋulu eapiyarito ŋikanikaarei inenekinitoe kiŋaren epeiwae epuke a akibois ŋin; toyakas daŋ ŋipirin ŋiuni ka ŋawoeta kec ŋauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lowae ŋoloce a akibois a ŋin, emaikina eyakasi ŋanaŋgae ŋuna erae aoyau kec ŋimitae ŋulu eapiyarito ŋikanikaarei; toyakas daŋ ŋipirin ŋiuni ka ŋawoeta kec ŋauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak lopuke ka alapatu a ŋina alokiŋa Eema ŋolo iryamununoi anaŋga ŋina erae aoyau alosepyon ŋimitae ŋikanikaomwon, toyakas ŋiraŋgi lu: Ŋolopus, ŋolo kipurat-areŋan ka ŋolo areŋan. Emaikina anaŋga ŋin erae ŋina amilimilan ŋina edonyuno ejok, ŋina edonyokinitoe nawae ŋiusyo ŋice ŋulu isibusitere. Emaikina eyakasi nen ŋipirin ŋiomwon ka ŋawoeta kec ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋipirin daadaŋ ŋulu eya nalapatu ŋin ilodotoi ke esilipa, toyakas ŋikodoce ŋulu ke esilipa; torae ŋawoeta a ŋipirin a ŋul ŋuna itiyaunitae ke eburonis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina aoyau a alapatu a ŋin alosepyon erae ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikanikapei, torae aoyau alokiŋaren ka neni iteotor ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiuni; toyakas ŋanaŋgae ŋuna inenosi ŋuna erae aoyau alokwap tari kidiama ŋimitae 2.3, torae ŋuna amilimilak ŋuna edonyuno ejok, ŋuna eropakinitae eburonis alokwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu isitiyao alotooma Eema ŋolo iryamununoi ka ŋases ŋuna ke Eema a ŋolo iryamununoi ta ŋases daadaŋ ŋuna ka alapatu a ŋina alokiŋa Eema ŋolo iryamununoi erae eburonis itiyaunitere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akimyet ŋina ke etaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emaikina iyoŋ tolimok Ŋisirael yautu neni kon akimyet ŋina ecuunitae alokito a ŋulu enyaritae Olipa, kinokonakinia iyoŋ etaa a ŋinakoloŋit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina Aron ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa kidara ŋitaae enokete ŋinapei eboŋ tari taparacu alokiŋaren Ekapolon, anakibois a ŋina ilipere a ŋina ayaaye anaŋga alokiŋaren Eema. Emaikina nu toruwor etal ŋolo erae eruba aneni a Ŋisirael tari a ananyameta a ŋuna eponito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
